source_status = "PUBLIC: system designation and broad role; see docs/REALISM.md. GAMEPLAY_ESTIMATE: every range, gain and classification figure here is a tuning value, not a performance claim. A small tactical drone flown to find out who is radiating and roughly where. Bearings only, like any electronic-support set."
